Package: selexprepR
Title: Preprocessing Public HT-SELEX Sequencing Data
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Marco", family = "Rotanegroni",
           email = "marco.rotanegroni@phd.unipd.it",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reproducible preprocessing for high-throughput
    SELEX sequencing data. Supports primer inference, extraction of random
    regions, sparse sequence counting across rounds, quality control, and
    provenance manifests. Public-study discovery and checksum-aware ENA FASTQ
    download planning are included for reproducible data acquisition.
